      "writtenOn": "2017-07-12T09:22:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can you please clarify the below point for me..\nIn this sample implementation, are you trying to move the device to ENABLED state only if the random choice results in DOWNLOAD_SUCCCEEDED. But, \"get_image_download_status\" is invoked only on user request. So, unless the user makes this request and the response results in \"DOWNLOAD_SUCCCEEDED\", the device will not move to ENABLED state?",
