      "writtenOn": "2017-07-28T20:29:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There are two trigger points for device to move from DOWNLOAD_IMAGE state to ENABLE state: one is when user issues the get_image_download_status and receives DOWNLOAD_SUCCEEDED state; the other is when the adapter receives download completion notification from device, the adapter will change the device state to ENABLE. Here is the sample implementation of 1st scenario.",
